# POST /api/parts input rules: required number and name, number at most 40, name at most 120, price 0..100,000,000, VAT
# 5/18/27 (422, reason in `detail`; exact limits pass). More: parts-vat-rates.http, parts-conflicts.http.

@AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress = {{$processEnv AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}
@WebUI_Origin = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_WEBUI_ORIGIN}}
@AdminEmail = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_EMAIL}}
@AdminPassword = {{$processEnv ARSM_TEST_ADMIN_PASSWORD}}
@RunId = {{$timestamp}}
@Key = ZZV{{RunId}}

### [Setup][Parts] Clear any session cookie left by a previous file (204 or 401, not asserted)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/logout
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}

###

### [Setup][Parts] Login as admin (200 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "{{AdminEmail}}", "password": "{{AdminPassword}}" }

{{
  exports.CsrfToken = response.headers['set-cookie']?.find(c => c.startsWith('__Host-arsm-csrf-token='))?.match(/^__Host-arsm-csrf-token=([^;]+)/)?.[1];
}}

?? status == 200

###

### [Negative][Parts] Empty part number (422 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "", "name": "Valid Name", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "PartNumber and Name are required.") == true

###

### [Negative][Parts] Whitespace-only name (422 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}", "name": "   ", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "PartNumber and Name are required.") == true

###

### [Negative][Parts] Part number of 41 characters (422 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{'P'.repeat(41)}}", "name": "Valid Name", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "PartNumber must be at most 40 characters.") == true

###

### [Negative][Parts] Name of 121 characters (422 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}", "name": "{{'N'.repeat(121)}}", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "Name must be at most 120 characters.") == true

###

### [Negative][Parts] Negative net price (422 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}", "name": "Valid Name", "netUnitPrice": -0.01, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "Amount must be at least 0 and at most 100,000,000.") == true

###

### [Negative][Parts] Net price over 100,000,000 (422 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}", "name": "Valid Name", "netUnitPrice": 100000000.01, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "Amount must be at least 0 and at most 100,000,000.") == true

###

### [Negative][Parts] Unsupported VAT rate 10 (422 expected)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}", "name": "Valid Name", "netUnitPrice": 100, "vatRatePercent": 10 }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "VAT rate must be 5, 18, or 27.") == true

###

### [Negative][Parts] A bad price and a bad VAT together (422 expected, the price is reported first)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}", "name": "Valid Name", "netUnitPrice": -1, "vatRatePercent": 10 }

?? status == 422
?? js (response.parsedBody.detail === "Amount must be at least 0 and at most 100,000,000.") == true

###

### [Negative][Parts] A non-numeric price fails model binding (400 expected, never a server error)
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}", "name": "Valid Name", "netUnitPrice": "abc", "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 400

###

### [Positive][Parts] The lower limits pass: price 0, a 40-character number, a 120-character name (201 expected)
# @name lowest
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}{{'L'.repeat(40 - Key.length)}}", "name": "{{'N'.repeat(120)}}", "netUnitPrice": 0, "vatRatePercent": 5 }

?? status == 201
?? js response.parsedBody.partNumber.length == 40
?? js response.parsedBody.name.length == 120
?? js response.parsedBody.netUnitPrice == 0
?? js response.parsedBody.grossUnitPrice == 0

###

### [Positive][Parts] The upper limit passes: price 100,000,000 (201 expected, gross 127,000,000.00)
# @name highest
POST {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "partNumber": "{{Key}}H", "name": "Highest Price", "netUnitPrice": 100000000, "vatRatePercent": 27 }

?? status == 201
?? js response.parsedBody.netUnitPrice == 100000000
?? js response.parsedBody.grossUnitPrice == 127000000

###

### [Positive][Parts] None of the refused requests created a row (200 expected, only the two boundary parts exist)
GET {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts?search={{Key}}

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.totalCount == 2

###

### [Cleanup][Parts] Delete the lowest-limit part (204 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{lowest.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204

###

### [Cleanup][Parts] Delete the highest-limit part (204 expected)
DELETE {{AutoService_ApiService_HostAddress}}/api/parts/{{highest.id}}
Origin: {{WebUI_Origin}}
X-CSRF-Token: {{CsrfToken}}

?? status == 204
